WEBVTT

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:34.990
The Hound of Hell's Gate

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.100
Captain...

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:09.980
Should we have...

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.820
just died as gods on that battlefield?

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:18.100
I... don't want to die.

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:22.610
I don't want to die like that!

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:33.370
Captain... You have no... justice.

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:37.630
Captain...

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:38.850
Captain Hank...

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:40.600
Why did you...

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:58.910
<i>I must... fulfill my oath...</i>

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:33.420
<i>Roy...</i>

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:39.980
Hank... Why do you keep 
declining Cain's invitation?

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:46.130
So you're not going to let go of the past.

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:48.940
I've been ordered to kill 
you if you don't comply!

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:57.280
If you go against our oath from that day,
 I will also have to kill you.

00:03:57.280 --> 00:03:59.500
Oh, please! Enough with the absurd threats.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:03.150
If I hadn't held back, 
you'd be dead right now!

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:09.720
You sure sound much more confident now, Roy.

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:13.590
Don't call me by that name.

00:04:13.590 --> 00:04:16.250
I am the Incarnate Garm!

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:00.560
How futile...

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:10.620
Why in the world is it snowing 
this time of year? This sucks...

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:12.370
Are you all right, Schaal?

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:13.470
Yes.

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:20.680
Just a few moments ago,

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:24.770
our advance unit spotted our next 
target in the central mountains.

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:29.260
Our target is the Incarnate Werewolf, 
Hank Henriette!

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:33.600
We will head to the location immediately 
and eliminate the target on sight.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:37.390
This monster is the one 
who destroyed Whitechurch!

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:39.140
Do not let him escape!

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:46.320
<i>If Claude were to encounter 
Hank right now...</i>

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:49.650
<i>I have to do something, but...</i>

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:08.450
Hank! Can you hear me?

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:13.030
You know very well that you 
can't get away from me!

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:19.640
I can smell your tension...

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:34.200
<i>I'll only have a moment's chance. 
I have to go for his throat.</i>

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:38.340
<i>No, that won't work... I have to go 
between his ribs and pierce his heart.</i>

00:07:02.760 --> 00:07:06.490
Transform, Hank. Fight me
in your Incarnate form!

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:09.240
Stop mocking me!

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:25.440
Sunrise...

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:37.480
I'm not going to let this end so easily.

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:44.810
I'll remind you of who you really are.

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:00.580
Does it hurt?

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.550
No, I'm fine.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:06.170
Muzzle Peak Fort is just ahead.

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:08.980
It's been abandoned for quite some time,

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:12.200
but it'll be a perfect place for us 
to rest while someone keeps watch.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:14.380
Let us head there for now.

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:18.980
No. If we do that, we'll lose Hank Henriette.

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:20.600
Let's hurry.

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:25.960
Major Claude!

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:27.560
Huh?

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:30.820
He has a terrible fever.

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:44.510
Where am I?

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:47.310
Are you all right?

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:49.900
How much time has passed?

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.680
It's evening now.

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:56.750
You mustn't push yourself!

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:59.750
If we just stay here, Hank Henriette will...

00:09:00.090 --> 00:09:04.600
I was told that Gerald sent 
scouting parties in every direction.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:07.940
We'll know immediately 
if they spot anything.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:09.300
I see...

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:12.590
I caused so much trouble for you.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:15.100
It's all right. I'm used to this.

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:20.430
I used to take care of the children 
back at the orphanage all the time.

00:09:24.070 --> 00:09:26.660
I think you were pushing yourself too hard.

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:29.020
Your leg is still wounded, too.

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:32.080
You need to rest so you can 
replenish some energy.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.220
Here you go.

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:44.110
Thank you.

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:53.370
Could you tell me something?

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:57.900
You'd been traveling with Hank Henriette,

00:09:57.900 --> 00:10:01.130
so you must have seen many Incarnates, 
as well as countless victims.

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:02.950
Yes.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:06.530
Plus the incident at Whitechurch, 
and what happened to your father...

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:10.210
Why do you insist on defending
these monsters that are nothing

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:12.590
but weapons to strike 
fear in people's hearts?

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.840
I can't help but think

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:19.970
that they didn't desire 
what happened to them.

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:23.820
They all wanted to live in peace.

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:29.050
If they had been able to connect 
more with the people around them,

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:32.690
they might've turned out differently...

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:35.260
You're just being idealistic.

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:37.610
I've seen it for myself!

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:43.150
There was an Incarnate living side by 
side with a human who understood her.

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:48.290
A connection with a human was keeping 
an Incarnate from losing herself!

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:53.090
I don't want to give up.

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:58.440
There must be a way for humans and 
Incarnates to live together peacefully.

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:00.500
Second Lieutenant.

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:03.520
Is the Major awake?

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:04.510
Yes.

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:07.960
Major Claude, how are you feeling?

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:09.510
I'm fine.

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:13.360
We've just received word 
from a returned scouting party.

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:15.140
They spotted Hank Henriette.

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:20.300
They also reported that they spotted 
another unidentified Incarnate, as well.

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:21.870
Another one?!

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:24.790
They say there were signs 
that Hank Henriette

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:27.880
was fighting with this other Incarnate.

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:32.390
Gerald, conduct a strategy 
meeting immediately!

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:33.980
Sir...

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:35.210
Right now!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:37.810
Yes, sir.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:41.120
Hank...

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:46.230
Captain...

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:47.390
Captain...

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:49.690
Captain...

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:52.240
Captain...

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:09.550
You look pathetic, Hank.

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:16.880
Very well... I shall free you.

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:06.750
Did you have some nice dreams, Hank?

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:14.810
Night is here. Now, let us continue.

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:20.600
This is our destination.

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:23.560
Our targets are two Incarnates.

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:26.950
We haven't confirmed the 
abilities of one of them,

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:29.410
which makes this a dangerous mission.

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:35.450
The other Incarnate is our original 
extermination target, Hank Henriette.

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:42.790
We will use everything we have 
to exterminate these two—

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:49.580
Major Claude, I will take over from here.

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:51.290
You don't need to worry about me.

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:56.190
No. You and a few other 
soldiers shall remain here.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:58.690
Why, you... Who do you think you are?!

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:02.230
Our battle does not end here.

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:07.480
We have to continue fighting until 
every last Incarnate is defeated.

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:10.410
Until then, we cannot have 
you collapsing on us.

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:17.100
Please allow the older soldiers to take care 
of this, and take better care of yourself!

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.420
Well, you heard him.

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:25.390
Let go of me, Second Lieutenant
 Liza Renecastle!

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:27.670
Oh, come now. Come, come.

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:28.170
Hey!

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:33.170
If you're lonely, I'll stick by your side 
and take care of you until you're better.

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:35.550
I promise I'll be more fun than Schaal.

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:39.360
This is no time for fooling around!

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:47.240
You're the only one fooling around.

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:51.530
You couldn't even shake a lady off of you.

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:53.160
What do you intend to do out there?

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:56.620
You should know that better than anyone else.

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:03.670
I swear on the honor of Coup de Grâce that 
we will take care of this matter on our own!

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:06.610
All right.

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:09.850
I'm counting on you, Sergeant Gerald Corlani.

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:11.180
Yes, sir!

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:14.570
Now that that's decided, 
let's go have some fun.

00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:17.330
Hey, stop that! I can walk on my own!

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:21.400
Come along. Don't worry, wittle boy,
 I'll take good care of you.

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:20.140
Are you listening to me, 
Second Lieutenant Liza Renecastle?!

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:25.470
As you just heard,
 I will be leading this mission.

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:29.090
Um... Please take me with you.

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:32.320
It's going to be dangerous.

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:34.850
I'm prepared.

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:37.910
Look at you. You're drenched in sweat.

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:39.840
Let go of me! I can take off my own jacket.

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:43.320
Aw, you're so cute when you're angry.

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:46.260
First Schaal Bancroft, and now you...

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:49.260
I'm not a child, you know.

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:52.560
Adults aren't as reckless as you.

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:00.220
How unpleasant...

00:16:00.220 --> 00:16:03.650
I can't believe I have to stay here while 
they go exterminate those Incarnates.

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:11.310
Schaal was trying to kill Hank at first, too.

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:16.120
But she decided to find out more 
rather than try to kill him.

00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:21.820
I'm sure she's still trying to figure 
out why this tragedy is happening.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:26.670
In the end, she might be 
more mature than all of us.

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:37.600
Hank... How long will you 
cling to your human form?

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:41.210
Try to kill me in your Incarnate form!

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:14.550
You're weak. You're so weak.

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:17.850
How did you become so weak?

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:21.810
Is the Hank from that day no longer around?

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:25.050
Did you actually die in that war?!

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:28.970
I remember your words clearly!

00:17:28.970 --> 00:17:32.660
You're the one who told 
us that we aren't Beasts!

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:35.370
We are Incarnates, 
with our own will and pride!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:39.170
That's right! We're Incarnates!

00:17:39.170 --> 00:17:41.450
Forget about the fact 
that you were once human!

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:43.840
Take back your will and pride!

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:46.220
This is our time!

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.490
You're wrong, Roy...

00:17:49.490 --> 00:17:53.410
Right now... you lack both will and pride...

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:57.250
You're just Cain's pet dog.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:00.620
Shut your mouth!

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:07.710
Fine! You can die here, Hank!

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:30.600
That sounded close. Prepare for battle!

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:36.120
Hank...

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:43.930
What the hell was that?

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:53.380
Are you done already?!

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:04.250
Hank!

00:20:19.430 --> 00:20:21.980
Right now, you have nothing!

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:25.850
On that day, you had undeniable dignity!

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:28.940
That's what saved us!

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:31.030
But what now?

00:20:31.030 --> 00:20:33.850
You can't even accept yourself!

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:36.960
You can only try to retain your dignity 
by looking away from the truth!

00:20:37.490 --> 00:20:43.410
Yet you say you're going to eliminate us 
in order to retain the squad's honor?!

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:44.940
Who do you think you are?!

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:47.240
You can't save us!

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:54.610
I...

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:57.560
This is the end.

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:06.210
Humans?

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:11.330
Hank!

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:21.520
Stay out of... my way!

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:44.910
Hank!

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:51.290
Hank!

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:28.170
Schaal, I have just one request...

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:29.460
What happened?!

00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:31.710
Half of the extermination 
squad has been annihilated.

00:23:31.710 --> 00:23:34.690
When that happens, 
I will be the one who kills you.

00:23:35.370 --> 00:23:39.650
There's a chance that I could've 
been good friends with you.

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:39.930
Two Oaths
